  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgResults: Innovation in Research and Delivery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the AgResults Initiative is to enhance smallholder welfare and food security for the poor and vulnerable in developing countries through increased investment in agricultural innovation and adoption.  It aims to do so by developing financial incentives (i.e. &#x201c;pull mechanisms&#x201d;) for private and public sector players to research, develop, and deliver products and services that will improve smallholder agriculture.  AgResults consists of a number of pilot projects across the developing world focused on either the adoption of existing technologies or the development and adaptation of new research and technologies.  The UK leads on a high quality research and evaluation component.</narrative>
  </description>
